---
description: Bosun locked architecture and current M1 scope
globs: ["**/*"]
alwaysApply: true
---

Follow `AGENTS.md` and accepted ADRs. Work on M1 only.

Never add libusb, WinUSB, Zadig, kext, kernel modules, GPL code, Tokio in `bosun-hid`, future crates, adapters, engine, GUI, injection, profiles, or control-plane code.

Use the measured protocol in `docs/BOSUN-PLAN.md`, the corrected key-bit rules in `AGENTS.md`, a synchronous `Transport` abstraction, a scripted `MockTransport`, and strict test-first development. Do not consult GPL G13 repositories.

Before reporting completion, run formatting, clippy with `-D warnings`, the full workspace test suite, and the relevant live-hardware acceptance test when hardware is required.
